      "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"group\" id=\"q6-7-8-9-anchor\"><h4>Questions 6-9</h4><p>Choose <strong>FOUR</strong> letters, <strong>A-E</strong>.</p><p>Which FOUR uses are listed for bioluminescence in nature?</p><div class=\"checkbox-options\" data-group=\"q6-7-8-9\" data-limit=\"4\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q6-7-8-9\" value=\"A\"> <strong>A</strong> ways of attracting food</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q6-7-8-9\" value=\"B\"> <strong>B</strong> tracing the spread of diseases</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q6-7-8-9\" value=\"C\"> <strong>C</strong> mating signals</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q6-7-8-9\" value=\"D\"> <strong>D</strong> growing trees for street lighting</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q6-7-8-9\" value=\"E\"> <strong>E</strong> drug trials</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q6-7-8-9\" value=\"F\"> <strong>F</strong> defensive tactics</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q6-7-8-9\" value=\"G\"> <strong>G</strong> a torch to identify food</label></div></div>",
